{"id":"c763f8f21c646741","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence.md","title":"先减再升变体的可核算小例","display":"ex-goodstein-small-sequence — 先减再升变体的可核算小例","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence","aliases":["72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence"],"display":"ex-goodstein-small-sequence — 先减再升变体的可核算小例","depends_on":["[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]]"],"chapter":"III","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Definition5.1, print191/PDF203; local explicit calculation","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-goodstein-small-sequence — 先减再升变体的可核算小例"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56f6604e5f04b50c\" href=\"?note=56f6604e5f04b50c\" title=\"72-df-goodstein-stopping-time\">72-df-goodstein-stopping-time</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Definition5.1, print191/PDF203; local explicit calculation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,\\ell_G\">\\(G,\\ell_G\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56f6604e5f04b50c\" href=\"?note=56f6604e5f04b50c\" title=\"72-df-goodstein-stopping-time\">72-df-goodstein-stopping-time</a> 的先减一再升底数变体。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle G_{3,4}(k)\\rangle_{k&lt;6}=\\langle4,4,3,2,1,0\\rangle,\\qquad\\ell_G(3,4)=5.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle G_{3,4}(k)\\rangle_{k&lt;6}=\\langle4,4,3,2,1,0\\rangle,\\qquad\\ell_G(3,4)=5.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一次4−1=3，完整底3式为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3^1\">\\(3^1\\)</span>，升到底4得4；第二次4−1=3 已小于底4，升到底5仍为3；随后依次减到2、1、0。这些值与普通“先升后减”版本不同，可用作实际定义顺序的回归样例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-goodstein-stopping-time","status":"resolved","id":"56f6604e5f04b50c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-goodstein-stopping-time","status":"resolved","id":"56f6604e5f04b50c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G,\\ell_G$ 使用 [[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] 的先减一再升底数变体。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G,\\ell_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle G_{3,4}(k)\\rangle_{k<6}=\\langle4,4,3,2,1,0\\rangle,\\qquad\\ell_G(3,4)=5.","display":true},{"tex":"3^1","display":false}],"bytes":1265,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-502","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"}],"outgoing":["56f6604e5f04b50c"]}